### Update existing (adds "hacker" to the "threat_actor_types")

POST {{BCBCTI_HostAddress}}/api/collections/default
Accept: application/taxii+json;version=2.1
Content-Type: application/taxii+json;version=2.1

{
	"objects": [
		{
